ent Reporting add-on","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=create-integration-profile&family=xanadu&ft:locale=en-US","line":111},{"title":"Integrate your SaaS applications with minimal user permissions","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=create-integration-profile&family=xanadu&ft:locale=en-US","line":115},{"title":"Get visibility into the login-based licenses of Salesforce CRM applications","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=integrate-with-salesforce-crm&family=xanadu&ft:locale=en-US","line":119},{"title":"License your organization for Oracle Java SE Universal with the Employee license metric","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=oracle-publisher-pack&family=xanadu&ft:locale=en-US","line":123},{"title":"Expand your analysis of asset information using the export capabilities in the Software Asset Workspace","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=sam-workspace&family=xanadu&ft:locale=en-US","line":127},{"title":"Improve Software Asset Management licensing outcomes with actionable insights into discovered inventory","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=analytics-workspace&family=xanadu&ft:locale=en-US","line":131},{"title":"Expand your analysis of overlapping software usage with added insights from spend transactions","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=app-ration&family=xanadu&ft:locale=en-US","line":135},{"title":"Determine license compliance for Microsoft Windows Server, SQL Server, and RHEL Server deployed on Nutanix virtualization technology","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=software-recon-virt-tech&family=xanadu&ft:locale=en-US","line":139},{"title":"Reduce manual effort for managing Microsoft Windows Server Client Access Licenses \\(CAL\\) with automated usage tracking","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=user-device-license-consumption&family=xanadu&ft:locale=en-US","line":14